# Locker Room's trigger is combat damage dealt "to a player" by creatures "you control" (CR 510.2, 603.2). Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with a Memnite and an
# Ornithopter (Black Lotus and two Moxen). On turn 3 the Memnite is blocked by Bot2's Ornithopter (its damage goes to a creature) while Bot1's own Ornithopter is
# unblocked but has 0 power, so it deals no damage at all; on turn 4 Bot2's Memnite hits Bot1 (a creature Bot1 does not control). No card is drawn
# for any of it: the library stays at 12 (13 less the turn-3 draw step) to the end of turn 4.

